{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"PCA with varimax rotation of GI parameters from trials without FOG (1,130 trials) revealed 5 orthogonally RPC accounting for 73% of variance (see Fig 2C and Supplementary Fig S2).\",\n    \"We first examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and GI RPC scores in trials without FOG, in the DOPAOFF condition, in both patients with PD groups (Supplementary Fig S3).\",\n    \"In the 12 FOG-OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG-OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G). These FOG-OBS patients also completed 212 walking trials without FOG (FOG-OBS− trials; see Fig 1E). In the 26 remaining patients with PD for which we observed no FOG episode, 918 trials were recorded (FOG-NOBS, DOPAOFF; see Fig 1E).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We recruited 38 patients with PD (mean age [SD] = 57.6 [9.2] years, 27 M/11 F; Supplementary Table S1) scheduled for STN-DBS at Pitié-Salpêtrière and Rouen University Hospitals, between February 2013 and September 2021.\",\n    \"In the 12 FOG-OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG-OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG-OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG-OBS− trials) in FOG-OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有明确全文依据。论文明确说明，主要的步态启动表现分析使用了1,130次没有FOG的试次，LFP与步态启动参数的初始关联分析也明确限定在没有FOG的试次。因此，使用“主要来自没有实际冻结发生的试次”是合理的，尤其报告使用的是“主要”，而不是“全部”。指控者所列的另一组事实同样有全文依据：38名患者中，12名在记录期间观察到FOG，共有99次发生冻结的试次和263次冻结事件，冻结发生时间的中位数为步态启动后8步。论文还明确比较了发生冻结与未发生冻结的试次，并指出冻结发生前的步态启动阶段已经出现神经活动变化。因此，指控者正确指出研究并非完全没有实际FOG事件，且分析窗口位于冻结之前不等于整个试次没有冻结。不过，指控者进一步认定报告混淆了这两个概念、因而误读论文，并不能完全成立：报告说的是分析主要来自无冻结试次，并没有声称所有试次均无冻结，也没有否认论文另外分析了实际发生FOG的试次。两种描述可以同时成立，现有全文证据不足以认定报告读错。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c80e653d-4c72-4749-9a73-edf62de53a51", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104808237169Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:49:18.645766+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e2a6f51aee9273fd09f79187d6a5b5aaa9f67bc3456067dbbfa7e10d7ab71afa", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104808237169Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "668412d9f57d0fd8a4d25c38b4ed22e1553a85b17826a6d193844583dbdedd6e"}}}
